Feature: PetStore API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Get a pet by ID successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/pet/1\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the pet ID\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/pet\"\n    When I send a POST request with the following data:\n      | id   | name    | status  |\n      | 1234 | Fluffy  | alive   |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the pet ID\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/pet\"\n    When I send a PUT request with the following data:\n      | id   | name    | status  |\n      | 1234 | Fluffy  | adopted |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the updated status\n\n  Scenario: Delete a pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/pet/1234\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should confirm deletion